CREATE TABLE "Attachment" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"orderId" TEXT NOT NULL,"objectKey" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"kind" TEXT NOT NULL,"contentType" TEXT NOT NULL,"size" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK ("size">0 AND "size"<=10485760),"sha256" TEXT NOT NULL,"uploadedBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,FOREIGN KEY("organizationId","orderId") REFERENCES "Order"("organizationId","id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE INDEX "Attachment_organizationId_orderId_idx" ON "Attachment"("organizationId","orderId");
CREATE TABLE "PendingUpload" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"orderId" TEXT NOT NULL,"objectKey" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"kind" TEXT NOT NULL,"contentType" TEXT NOT NULL,"size" INTEGER NOT NULL,"sha256" TEXT NOT NULL,"uploadedBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"expiresAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL);
CREATE INDEX "PendingUpload_organizationId_orderId_idx" ON "PendingUpload"("organizationId","orderId");
CREATE TABLE "Document" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"orderId" TEXT NOT NULL,"type" TEXT NOT NULL,"objectKey" TEXT UNIQUE,"snapshot" JSONB NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"createdBy" TEXT NOT NULL,FOREIGN KEY("organizationId","orderId") REFERENCES "Order"("organizationId","id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE);
CREATE INDEX "Document_organizationId_orderId_type_idx" ON "Document"("organizationId","orderId","type");
